      "why": "The next step in addressing the challenge of determining thermodynamic properties of HEAs is to develop and apply new computational methods, such as high-throughput screening, to rapidly and accurately predict these properties. This approach can help to identify the most promising HEAs and optimize their compositions and processing conditions for improved performance."
